{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgRxufv7SDfXXDpke3ryG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed two of the causes and made an unconfirmed fix for the third. I didn't test any of it against the real Intervals.icu. The causes are written up in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n1. **Connect button gave Unauthorized (confirmed).**\n   - The button was a plain link. A browser navigation can't send the `Authorization: Bearer` header, so the server rejected every athlete.\n   - The button now asks the server for the authorize URL through the app's normal request wrapper, then sends the browser there. The server returns the URL as JSON when the request asks for JSON, and still redirects for other callers.\n\n2. **Intervals answers the authorize step with `400 invalid_request` (unconfirmed).**\n   - The 400 began when the calendar scopes were added on 2026-10-02. The request also never sent `response_type=code`.\n   - I couldn't reach Intervals' OAuth docs, and the error doesn't say which parameter it dislikes. I added `response_type=code` and trimmed the scopes to `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`.\n   - I dropped the separate READ scopes because Rivera's working token was granted WRITE without them. Please try a real connection. If it still returns 400, remove the calendar scope first to see whether that's the cause.\n\n3. **Connections expired after an hour (confirmed from the logs).**\n   - Intervals' token response has no `expires_in` and no `refresh_token`, so the token appears to be long-lived. The server assumed a one-hour lifetime and then marked the connection \"expired, reconnect\" because it had no refresh token.\n   - A token with no stated lifetime is now treated as non-expiring, and refresh only runs when Intervals gives an expiry. Rivera needs to reconnect once, since their stored connection is already marked expired.\n\nThe changes are in `server.py`, `config.py` and `static/app.js`. I only checked that `server.py` compiles."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2778,"cache_read_input_tokens":30218,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2778},"output_tokens":649,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb4e895f-7112-456f-a00d-76dda8e96b4a","uuid":"de4cade5-b5e6-45ad-97ef-355ce6d7a6a5","timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:37:23.920Z","request_id":"req_011CgRxuffihZ8VrPNZmBYsY"}
